Conflicts: kde-config-krdp, krdp-console-test, krdp-virtual-test
Replaces: kde-config-krdp, krdp-console-test, krdp-virtual-test
Description: KDE RDP server (Steve's fork) with console and retained desktops
 KRdp shares a Plasma Wayland desktop over RDP with H.264 (AVC420/AVC444)
 video, audio, microphone, camera and clipboard redirection.
 .
 This build adds the physical-console host (krdp-console-host and
 krdp-console-worker), which keeps one RDP transport across the SDDM greeter
 and the seat0 Plasma session, and the retained virtual-desktop broker
 (krdp-virtual-host) with its guardian, PAM keeper and cleanup helpers.
 Both system services are installed disabled. It bundles a patched private
 KPipeWire in /usr/lib/<triplet>/krdp that does not replace the system one.
